## Paste an id from a create user response (POST /users or /auth/signup)
@userId = paste-user-id-here

## Log in first (see auth.endpoint.http), otherwise every list request - expect 401

## Get users (default limit=10, page=1) - expect 200
GET http://localhost:3000/users

###
## Get users with pagination - expect 200
GET http://localhost:3000/users?limit=5&page=1

###
## limit above 100 (@Max(100)) - expect 400
GET http://localhost:3000/users?limit=500

###
## Get user by id - expect 200 (or 404 if it doesn't exist)
GET http://localhost:3000/users/{{userId}}

###
## Unknown user id - expect 404
GET http://localhost:3000/users/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

###
## id not a UUID (ParseUUIDPipe) - expect 400
GET http://localhost:3000/users/abc
